<title>CHINA: Trading in Liang Shing shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Liang Shing shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Liang Shing (Holdings) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the sports shoe maker closed at HK$0.71 each on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
